{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/f5ea9fd6e7e69377ef06f6c8d8d9d8f3.avif?t=1771491417\" width=600 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/6e7c9e91a42bfb2d982a7feea3d1860e.poster.avif?t=1771491417\" width=611 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/6e7c9e91a42bfb2d982a7feea3d1860e.webm?t=1771491417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your very first step out of the family house! Discover a mysterious outer world inhabited by zany creatures called Risimon. In this epic quest you follow Celestine, a 25-year-old kidult whose actions have crossed the line.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make a clean break from the past and set out on a grand journey across Issou! Discover a land shrouded in mystery and plots, but full of lovable Risimons!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/3091414abec6dc8932d9499296f675ad.poster.avif?t=1771491417\" width=611 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/3091414abec6dc8932d9499296f675ad.webm?t=1771491417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/350387ad172bb4678450b7e2e722928a.poster.avif?t=1771491417\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/350387ad172bb4678450b7e2e722928a.webm?t=1771491417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/350387ad172bb4678450b7e2e722928a.mp4?t=1771491417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Once out of the family nest, it is up to you how to lead your adventure: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play </strong> Celestine, a constantly belittled kidult with no charisma or wisdom, unwillingly embarked on crazy events\u2026 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience </strong> a searing satire through a comical story. A perfect blend inspired by the current way of the world and the Internet culture. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover </strong> the 10 main zones of Issou, from Forumborough to Wokehaven. Every zone embodies a specific theme, with its own design and characteristic inhabitants.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore </strong> numerous secondary zones, complete unique quests and side storylines, unveil long-forgotten secrets\u2026  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet </strong> hundreds of hilarious characters and ludicrous creatures, all of them having a specifically-written development and specifically-designed appearance. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow </strong> the story of Chad, Emily, Corentine and that of many other memorable characters you will encounter on your adventure!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/dc205734709b4a3b7cf51d1d4d30761c.poster.avif?t=1771491417\" width=649 height=177 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/dc205734709b4a3b7cf51d1d4d30761c.webm?t=1771491417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/01f55139740de53696def4dbcf94a3ad.poster.avif?t=1771491417\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/01f55139740de53696def4dbcf94a3ad.webm?t=1771491417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/extras/01f55139740de53696def4dbcf94a3ad.mp4?t=1771491417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Risimons can be caught to form a team ready for action! Defeat any of the opponents you encounter on your journey!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find and catch</strong> those untamed creatures, embodiments of crazy, ludicrous or cynical themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Form </strong> a team worthy of the name, overcome trials and champions in their Gyms all over the region. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train </strong> your team, rise to the trickiest challenges the game offers.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2471680?t=1771491417","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771491417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471680/36dca1d0c5062c2b8a78d123a37dc1c35bec7ec0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771491417","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamst